{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bush Dog is a game where you herd sheep on different maps, with more sheep  added each round until you run out of time. Where you go again to best your high score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Found a way to get the sheep into the blue area as fast as possible. Each round will increase the amount of sheep\u00a0until the timer runs out on multiple different maps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player Customisation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player help you make your own\u00a0individual with different patterns, colours and later hats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three maps in the game so far each with their different\u00a0challenges with easy and harder maps. One map build for speed and another map for a greater\u00a0challenge. With Easy, mid and hard difficultly that\u00a0provides different game play. With plans to add more map with more different animal and unique challenges inspired by real life herding.\u00a0   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Road Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plans to add more customization for the player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Maps to play: Both hard and easy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More different animals to herd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo Trailer Music Unbreakable by Andy Ray</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949930?t=1758859880","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949930?t=1758859880","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949930/1d92876c18aeca821500cd39b0fa748e5ca48b41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758859880","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949930/1d92876c18aeca821500cd39b0fa748e5ca48b41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758859880","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bush Dog is a game where you herd sheep on different maps, with more sheep  added each round until you run out of time. Where you go again to best your high score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Found a way to get the sheep into the blue area as fast as possible. Each round will increase the amount of sheep\u00a0until the timer runs out on multiple different maps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player Customisation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player help you make your own\u00a0individual with different patterns, colours and later hats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three maps in the game so far each with their different\u00a0challenges with easy and harder maps. One map build for speed and another map for a greater\u00a0challenge. With Easy, mid and hard difficultly that\u00a0provides different game play. With plans to add more map with more different animal and unique challenges inspired by real life herding.\u00a0   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Road Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plans to add more customization for the player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Maps to play: Both hard and easy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More different animals to herd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo Trailer Music Unbreakable by Andy Ray</p>","developers":["Redcollarwolf"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3941470","name":"Bush Dog"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulati